<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#ClinicalGovernance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A system through which service providers are accountable for continuously improving the quality of their clinical practice and safeguarding high standards of care by creating an environment in which excellence in clinical care will flourish. This includes mechanisms for monitoring clinical quality and safety through structured programmes, for example, clinical audit." .
