<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#EmpiricalAntimicrobialTherapy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Antimicrobial therapy given for an anticipated and likely cause of infection based upon probability, but where the causative micro-organism has not yet been identified through microbiological testing" .
