<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Hygiene> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The practice that serves to keep people and the environment clean. In a healthcare setting it incorporates the following key areas: environment and facilities, hand hygiene, management of laundry, waste and sharps, and equipment, specifically in the context of preventing and controlling infection" .
