<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#ImmunosuppressiveTreatment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Treatment which lowers the body’s immune response, therefore increasing the risk for infection. Examples include medications (such as steroids, biologics), procedures (chemotherapy/ haematopoietic stem cell transplantation) and surgeries (solid organ transplants)" .
