<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#IncidentReview> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#IncidentReview> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
