<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#IncidentalFindings> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Incident Management Framework 2020 / HSE Incident Management Framework - Guidance 2020" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#IncidentalFindings> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Issue(s) that arose in the process of delivering and managing health services identified during the course of a review which the reviewers consider did not impact on the outcomes but which serve to identify issues for system improvement e.g. issues relating to documentation, communications etc" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#IncidentalFindings> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#IncidentalFindings> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Incidental Findings" .
