<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Infection> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The invasion and reproduction of pathogenic or disease-causing micro-organisms inside the body that may cause tissue injury and disease" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Infection> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Infection> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Infection" .
