<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControl> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControl> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "19/05/21" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Lucy" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HIQA National Standards for the Prevention and Control of Healthcare-Associated Infections 2017" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The discipline and practice of preventing and controlling healthcare-associated infectionand the spread of infectious diseases in a healthcare service" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Infection Prevention and Control" .
# 
# https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlCommittee
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlCommittee> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlCommittee> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlCommittee> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "19/05/21" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlCommittee> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Lucy" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlCommittee> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HIQA National Standards for the Prevention and Control of Healthcare-Associated Infections 2017" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlCommittee> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A multidisciplinary group of people from within and outside a hospital or groups of hospitals, which reports to senior management. The committee is responsible for the review and oversight of the service to prevent and control infection in the hospital or hospitals in question. The membership of the committee should balancedbetween clinical and management staff" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlCommittee> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlCommittee> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Infection Prevention and Control Committee" .
# 
# https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlNurse
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlNurse> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlNurse> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlNurse> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "19/05/21" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlNurse> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Lucy" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlNurse> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HIQA National Standards for the Prevention and Control of Healthcare-Associated Infections 2017" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlNurse> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A nurse with specialist postgraduate qualifications and expert knowledge in infection prevention and control. The IPCN acts as anadvocate for the patientin quality improvement, safety and risk. IPCNslead and implement the hospital or service infection prevention and control annualplan. The IPCN engages in activities such as:act as an advisor in management of outbreaks;development of healthcare facilities;surveillance;audit;decontamination and the education of all healthcare workers and outside contractors" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlNurse> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlNurse> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Infection Prevention and Control Nurse (IPCN)" .
# 
# https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlProgramme
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#InfectionPreventionAndControlProgramme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
