# https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#NearMiss
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#NearMiss> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#NearMiss> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#NearMiss> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "18/12/2020" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#NearMiss> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Lucy" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#NearMiss> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Incident Management Framework - Guidance 2020" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#NearMiss> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An incident that was prevented from occurring due to timely intervention or chance and which there are reasonable grounds for believing could have resulted, if it had not been so prevented, in unintended or unanticipated injury or harm to a service user during the provision of a health service to that service user.(National Standards for the Conduct of Reviews of Patient Safety Incidents)" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#NearMiss> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#NearMiss> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Near Miss" .
