# https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RelevantPerson
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RelevantPerson> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RelevantPerson> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RelevantPerson> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "18/12/2020" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RelevantPerson> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Lucy" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RelevantPerson> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Incident Management Framework 2020" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RelevantPerson> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "“Relevant person”, in relation to a patient, means a person;(a) who is;(i) a parent, guardian, son or daughter,(ii) a spouse, or(iii) a civil partner of the patient,(b) who is cohabiting with the patientor(c) whom the patient has nominated in writing to the health services provider as a person to whom clinical information in relation to the patient may be disclosed(Civil Liability (Amendment) Act 2017)" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RelevantPerson> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RelevantPerson> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Relevant Person" .
