<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskEvaluation> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Rob" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskEvaluation> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Integrated Risk Management Policy - Part 1/ISO 31000:2009" .
