<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskEvaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
