<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#SafetyCulture> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An integrated pattern of individual and organisational behaviour, based upon shared beliefs and values, which continuously seeks to minimise service user harm which may result from the processes of care delivery." .
