<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#SharedDecision-Making> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Patients and clinicians reach decisions about treatment together, with a shared understanding of the condition, the options available and the risks and benefits of each of those" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#SharedDecision-Making> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
