<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#SingleRoom> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A patient bedroom which accommodates one patient only.Single rooms should also have en-suite facilities. Isolation in a single room is effective in reducing transmission of infections spread by the contact or droplet routes, when combined with other infection prevention and control measures such as hand hygiene and personal protective equipment" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#SingleRoom> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
