<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Staff> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Incident Management Framework 2020 / HSE Incident Management Framework - Guidance 2020" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Staff> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "(a) a person who(i) has entered into, or works under (or where the employment has ceased, had entered into or worked under), a contract of employment, with the health services provider, or(ii) is (or was) placed for the purpose of vocational training with the health services provider, and(b) a fixed-term employee of the health services provider, and a reference to an employee, in relation to a health services provider, shall be construed as a reference to an employee employed by that health services provider.In line with the definition of Employee as defined in the (Civil Liability Amendment Act, 2017)" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Staff> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
