# https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#StrategicRisk
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#StrategicRisk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#StrategicRisk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#StrategicRisk> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "7/9/20" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#StrategicRisk> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Rob" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#StrategicRisk> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Integrated Risk Management Policy - Part 1/ISO 31000:2009" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#StrategicRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A strategic risk has the ability to impact on the achievement/delivery of the HSE’s strategic objectives/directions. Strategic risks relate to the highest level of objective for the HSE, which typically have a long-term focus and are linked to the HSE’s Strategic Plan." .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#StrategicRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#StrategicRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Strategic Risk" .
# 
# https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Surveillance
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Surveillance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Surveillance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
