<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Surveillance> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HIQA National Standards for the Prevention and Control of Healthcare-Associated Infections 2017" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Surveillance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The ongoing systematic collection, collation, analysis and interpretation of data; and the sharing of information to those who need to know in order that action may be taken" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Surveillance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Surveillance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Surveillance" .
