<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Treatment> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Integrated Risk Management Policy - Part 1/ISO 31000:2009" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Treatment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Additional mechanisms, processes, procedures or actions to be implemented, which seek to reduce the current likelihood and/or consequence and reach the Residual Risk Rating." .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Treatment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Treatment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Treatment" .
