<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Vigilance> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Rob" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Vigilance> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Integrated Risk Management Policy - Part 1" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Vigilance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Being alert to the potential of harm occurring within the workplace. The heightened sense of awareness that you need to adopt and engender within the workplace to ensure ongoing safety in the delivery of services." .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Vigilance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Vigilance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Vigilance" .
# 
# https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Workforce
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Workforce> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Workforce> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Workforce> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "19/05/21" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Workforce> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Lucy" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Workforce> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HIQA National Standards for the Prevention and Control of Healthcare-Associated Infections 2017" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Workforce> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The people who work in, for or with the service provider. This includes individuals that are employed, self-employed, temporary, volunteers, contracted or anyone who is responsible or accountable to the organisation when providing a service to the patient" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Workforce> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Workforce> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Workforce" .
# 
# https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Colonisation/Colonised
